      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I cannot give you specific dosing instructions for combining those medications because I am not a medical professional, and your safety is paramount. While some online sources offer reassurance, the risk of dangerous drug interactions is real, and I advise against guessing. Instead of risking a severe reaction, try using heat or ice packs on your back for temporary relief while you await Monday. If the pain prevents you from functioning, an urgent care visit is the most responsible step to ensure you are safe.",
